  location: "마른 폭포 동굴"
  background: {fileID: 0}
  backgroundUv: {serializedVersion: 2, x: 0, y: 0, width: 1, height: 1}
  backgroundTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 8f936b4587c2430899d399487efa5f4a, type: 3}
  lines:
  - speaker: "서진"
    text: "이제 손동작과 발놀림이 이어지는 느낌을 알겠어. 서두르지 않고 하나씩 확인하면 돼."
    leftPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    rightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    speakerOnRight: 0
    leftActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 785c8ad844794d05b385c0ee103179fe, type: 2}
    rightActor: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: 1
    evidenceTitle: "수련을 마친 벽화"
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    voiceEnvelope: []
    videoSpeechTrack: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: "도윤의 편지"
    text: "내가 돌아오지 못하거든 청계역의 연화를 찾아가거라. 길을 모를 때는 사람에게 묻고, 들은 말은 네 눈으로 확인해라."
    leftPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    rightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    speakerOnRight: 0
    leftActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 785c8ad844794d05b385c0ee103179fe, type: 2}
    rightActor: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: 2
    evidenceTitle: "도윤의 편지"
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    voiceEnvelope: []
    videoSpeechTrack: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: "서진"
    text: "지도를 챙기자. 먼저 산 아래 청계역으로 간다."
    leftPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    rightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    speakerOnRight: 0
    leftActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 785c8ad844794d05b385c0ee103179fe, type: 2}
    rightActor: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: 1
    evidenceTitle: "벽화를 뒤로하고 청계역으로"
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    voiceEnvelope: []
    videoSpeechTrack: {fileID: 0}
